#. module: cyllo_appointment_crm
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:cyllo_appointment_crm.field_appointment_type__lead_create
msgid ""
"For each confirmed appointment of this type, automatically create a new CRM "
"opportunity and assign it to the responsible user (staff member). If the "
"customer already has an active opportunity with that staff member, the "
"appointment is linked to the existing one instead."
msgstr ""
"Za svaki potvrđeni sastanak ove vrste automatski se kreira nova CRM prilika i dodjeljuje odgovornom korisniku (članu osoblja). Ako klijent već ima aktivnu priliku s tim članom osoblja, sastanak se umjesto toga povezuje s postojećom."

